email-001,2026-11-02T09:10:00-05:00,mia@acme.example,"[""alex@contextlab.example""]",[],Customer portal kickoff,"We want account login, invoice history, and a support-request form in the first pilot. Please treat downloadable invoices as in scope; payment processing is not part of phase one.",acme-kickoff,acme
email-002,2026-11-02T10:20:00-05:00,daniel@nova.example,"[""priya@contextlab.example""]",[],Inventory integration kickoff,"We need warehouse stock quantities reflected on our storefront. Initial target is a 15-minute sync and a pilot on December 8, subject to warehouse API access.",nova-kickoff,nova
email-003,2026-11-02T11:05:00-05:00,ella@orion.example,"[""sam@contextlab.example""]",[],Dashboard kickoff and KPIs,"The MVP dashboard needs weekly revenue, conversion rate, and support response time, broken down by region. Our initial target is a December 10 stakeholder demo.",orion-kickoff,orion
email-004,2026-11-03T08:45:00-05:00,alex@contextlab.example,"[""mia@acme.example""]",[],Re: Customer portal kickoff,"Confirmed. We will prototype login, invoice list/download, and support requests. We will exclude online payment processing. Please identify your final approval contact for design changes.",acme-kickoff,acme
email-005,2026-11-03T13:30:00-05:00,priya@contextlab.example,"[""daniel@nova.example""]",[],Re: Inventory integration kickoff,We can build the integration against sandbox endpoints first. Please send API credentials and clarify whether storefront updates may lag during overnight warehouse maintenance.,nova-kickoff,nova
email-006,2026-11-04T09:15:00-05:00,sam@contextlab.example,"[""ella@orion.example""]",[],Re: Dashboard kickoff and KPIs,We will use weekly aggregates for the MVP and show three KPI cards by region. We need the canonical revenue definition before finalizing the data model.,orion-kickoff,orion
email-007,2026-11-05T14:20:00-05:00,mia@acme.example,"[""alex@contextlab.example""]",[],Design review feedback,"The login and invoice screens look good. Could we also add a chatbot? This is a request for discussion, not approval to change scope.",acme-design,acme
email-008,2026-11-06T10:00:00-05:00,daniel@nova.example,"[""priya@contextlab.example""]",[],Warehouse API access,Sandbox API key is provisioned; production credentials are still pending security review. Warehouse downtime is normally 01:00–01:30 EST.,nova-api,nova
email-009,2026-11-06T15:40:00-05:00,ella@orion.example,"[""sam@contextlab.example""]",[],Revenue metric definition,"Use recognized revenue, net of refunds, attributed to the order’s billing region. Do not use gross checkout value. Please confirm this definition in the dashboard spec.",orion-metrics,orion
email-010,2026-11-09T09:05:00-05:00,alex@contextlab.example,"[""mia@acme.example""]",[],Re: Design review feedback,A chatbot would require new testing and privacy review. We recommend deferring it to phase two. We will not implement it without written approval.,acme-design,acme
email-011,2026-11-09T11:50:00-05:00,priya@contextlab.example,"[""daniel@nova.example""]",[],Sync implementation plan,"We will queue changes during warehouse downtime and retry after recovery. We still target 15-minute refresh intervals, with a delayed status indicator when updates are stale.",nova-sync,nova
email-012,2026-11-10T16:10:00-05:00,sam@contextlab.example,"[""ella@orion.example""]",[],Re: Revenue metric definition,"Confirmed: recognized revenue minus refunds, grouped by billing region. Our data validation work will use that definition.",orion-metrics,orion
email-013,2026-11-11T09:30:00-05:00,mia@acme.example,"[""alex@contextlab.example""]",[],Re: Design review feedback,"Approved: defer chatbot to phase two. Keep phase-one delivery focused on login, invoice history/download, and the support form.",acme-design,acme
email-014,2026-11-11T13:00:00-05:00,daniel@nova.example,"[""priya@contextlab.example""]",[],Inventory identifiers mismatch,We discovered some storefront SKUs use leading zeros while warehouse IDs do not. Please do not normalize away leading zeros without a mapping table.,nova-sku,nova
email-015,2026-11-12T08:35:00-05:00,ella@orion.example,"[""sam@contextlab.example""]",[],Request to add churn metric,Would it be possible to include customer churn in the December demo? This is only a proposal; I need the product director to sign off.,orion-churn,orion
email-016,2026-11-12T14:50:00-05:00,alex@contextlab.example,"[""mia@acme.example""]",[],Pilot date proposal,Testing the invoice download flow may take longer than estimated. I propose moving the pilot from December 1 to December 5; this is not yet approved.,acme-date,acme
email-017,2026-11-13T10:25:00-05:00,priya@contextlab.example,"[""daniel@nova.example""]",[],Re: Inventory identifiers mismatch,Reproduced. We will preserve SKU strings and build an explicit SKU mapping table. This blocks reconciliation testing until Nova supplies the authoritative crosswalk.,nova-sku,nova
email-018,2026-11-13T15:20:00-05:00,sam@contextlab.example,"[""ella@orion.example""]",[],Re: Request to add churn metric,Churn requires customer-status history we do not currently have. Recommend excluding it from the MVP unless the product director approves and provides data.,orion-churn,orion
email-019,2026-11-16T09:00:00-05:00,mia@acme.example,"[""alex@contextlab.example""]",[],Re: Pilot date proposal,"The December 5 pilot is approved, on the condition that security sign-off and invoice-download QA are complete by December 3.",acme-date,acme
