email-022,2026-11-17T09:10:00-05:00,alex@contextlab.example,"[""mia@acme.example""]",[],Invoice download bug found,"QA found that invoice PDFs sometimes download under the wrong filename. We are fixing this before December 3. No evidence of cross-account data exposure, but security review is still open.",acme-bug,acme
